- mtmd_helper_decode_image_chunk_impl(): request logits from the last media
  embedding when the chunk-evaluation helpers ask for them.
- Video decoder interface, see mtmd-helper.h.patch. mtmd_helper_video only talks
  to a mtmd_helper_video_decoder; upstream's ffmpeg/ffprobe code moved to
  mtmd-helper-video-ffmpeg.cpp as the built-in decoder (MTMD_VIDEO only). For a
  decoder that yields every frame, the helper picks the frames of fps_target by
  index (sample_by_index) and skips the others without converting them.
